'''Nyanko Village Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by beating any stage in [[Puzzle Bonanza! Nyanko Village Collaboration Event#Puzzle Bonanza! Nyanko Village|Puzzle Bonanza! Nyanko Village]]. It was added in [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 856
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Nyanko Village Cat
|name2 = Nyanko Village Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Nyanko Village Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
A pathetic crowd-controller that struggles to find a place. Their 30% chance to [[Freeze]] Aliens only lasts for 4-seconds, which hardly covers their 6.3-second attack rate. It barely suffices for melee pushers like Star Peng or Nimoy Bore, but that is as far as it goes.

Their Single Attack hinders it further, though they do have a 20% chance to create an [[Explosion]] that theoretically can pierce up to 535. Even with this, the chance said Explosion even carries a Freeze is not worth considering in a practical sense. [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] will always prove more useful outside of {{4c}}.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump & Crowd-Controller}}

